Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.09,0:00:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：鲨鱼和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.87,0:00:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也是在复仇心和愤怒中开始的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.45,0:00:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了获胜，鲨鱼召唤出了 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.72,0:00:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那强烈的连续8次攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.37,0:00:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让他倒在了场地上！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.25,0:00:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼，难道说，你…！？＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.47,0:00:16.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.53,0:00:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.17,0:00:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.45,0:00:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}振作一点，鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶…星光体
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.55,0:00:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个就没什么办法吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:26.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）不可能的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.19,0:00:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）那条锁链是由异晶界的力量形成的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.76,0:00:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只拥有星光体世界力量的你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是无法解开它的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.13,0:00:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）的话　只要把你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.38,0:00:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用决斗打倒就行了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来做个了断吧　托隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.62,0:00:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗…　现在　我不想呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.57,0:00:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为　有趣的表演就看不到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼哈哈哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.34,0:00:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！　这种锁链用我的飞冲…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.49,0:00:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:01:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一马也　那是他的口头禅。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.21,0:01:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是　他没能从异世界回来…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）凌牙　我不允许你投降…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.61,0:01:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧　站起来　凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.50,0:01:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站起来　冲我过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.45,0:01:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最后的…　然后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.75,0:01:20.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给你最棒的粉丝福利！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼·德雷克）凌牙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.70,0:01:28.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.27,0:01:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.39,0:01:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.81,0:01:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正是 接受我的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.48,0:01:40.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与我 合为一体吧 凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接受我吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.59,0:01:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要……我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.82,0:01:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已经……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.98,0:01:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不会被什么 No. 吞噬。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 鲨鱼！ 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.15,0:01:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.75,0:01:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好像 样子不太对劲……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.04,0:02:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他在痛苦……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.11,0:02:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.39,0:02:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.再次试图支配他的心。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？ 唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.74,0:02:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼·德雷克）接受吧……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.18,0:02:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接受我解放心之暗吧……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要赢的话　就接受我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:24.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我　合为一体吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.29,0:02:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.36,0:02:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要…　我　我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.91,0:02:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…　已经绝对…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.66,0:02:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会再被任何人　操纵了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合　抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.25,0:04:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动永续魔法异次元海沟！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.90,0:04:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只水属性怪兽除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.02,0:04:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除外？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.19,0:04:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不　这样就好！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.07,0:04:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他斩断了 No.的诱惑{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.20,0:04:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将其除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连天堂之弦的效果也
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.30,0:04:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一并无效化了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.06,0:04:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害～。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.34,0:04:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太厉害了 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.77,0:04:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 将新的怪兽以里侧守备表示 盖放！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.75,0:04:49.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样… 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.13,0:04:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夸夸你吧 凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.19,0:04:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你居然 没想到竟然会放弃鲨鱼·德雷克。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:04:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 这样一来你就失去了王牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而 我这边 攻击力3000的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天堂之弦依然健在。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.13,0:05:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.14,0:05:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备着命运之弦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.82,0:05:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就像刚才那样连续攻击也是可能的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.20,0:05:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你已经没有胜算了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.53,0:05:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备魔法 命运之弦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.93,0:05:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风险也很大。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.38,0:05:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:25.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要发动它的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}需要从卡组将1张卡送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.07,0:05:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是那张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.25,0:05:37.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须是怪兽卡才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果抽到的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.85,0:05:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是怪兽的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.25,0:05:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就无法攻击，战斗就此结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才运气好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽到了怪兽就是了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.06,0:05:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是信不过我咯。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说的是概率问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.19,0:05:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毕竟我是科学家嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.85,0:05:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你从以前就是这样呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.25,0:06:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和冷静慎重的V还有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不同{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.21,0:06:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是直情型，动不动就热血上头。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看，又来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.09,0:06:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在还是冷静想想比较好哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前提是你能做得到就是了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实，正如特隆所说。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去冒那种危险赌注的好处究竟有没有呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我，我……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.96,0:06:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就那么不能信任吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为没法像V和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样成为忠实的仆从。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.97,0:06:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是，我也为了你……为了您{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.08,0:06:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.58,0:06:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸总是温柔地微笑着{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}温暖地守护着我们兄弟。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.77,0:06:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然而
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.65,0:06:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从异世界归来的爸爸{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.09,0:06:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经彻底变成了另一个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.85,0:06:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成了冷酷的复仇鬼特隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.75,0:06:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即便如此，我们还是追随了特隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.50,0:07:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照命令 将凌牙引入陷阱连那家伙的妹妹也…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.81,0:07:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别装成受害者！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.65,0:07:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你是被利用的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.93,0:07:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也 对你做过的事绝对不会原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.01,0:07:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没打算逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你的了断 就在这里解决！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我会赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒Dr.费卡的人是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.06,0:07:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会让你成为Dr.费卡的刺客。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要打倒Dr.费卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.67,0:07:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆一定也会变回以前的样子…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.36,0:07:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变回我的父亲 拜隆·阿克莱特我相信他会回来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 是想着你到这种地步{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.41,0:07:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了你才做出这种残忍的事！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.15,0:07:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可即便如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算这样你还是不肯！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不肯相信我吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.64,0:07:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不信。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.13,0:07:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已经谁都不信了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我能相信的只有我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.89,0:07:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有巴利安世界而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.32,0:08:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救了我一命的是他们啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.57,0:08:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.61,0:08:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我终究不过是你的棋子罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是被你用完就丢的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.93,0:08:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我可不是普通的棋子。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.39,0:08:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我好歹也是决斗的亚洲冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.83,0:08:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能轻易就被你用完丢掉开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.52,0:08:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.23,0:08:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少开玩笑了！我要让你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我既有实力也有运气。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.53,0:08:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 装备魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.88,0:08:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了命运之弦的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天堂之弦 攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又要玩那个赌博吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.38,0:08:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组抽1张卡送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那是怪兽卡的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.12,0:09:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能按等级次数进行攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙 这就是你的最后了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 果然和我担心的一样呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.59,0:09:11.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽到的是陷阱卡或者魔法卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.52,0:09:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能… 为什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.88,0:09:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的战斗也结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.14,0:09:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 还没结束呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.48,0:09:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤机关傀儡 剪刀臂！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏场上的装备卡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.56,0:09:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级变成2倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我破坏装备在天堂之弦上的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}命运之弦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.65,0:09:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 剪刀臂的等级变成8。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.35,0:09:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.81,0:09:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}手牌里既然有那种怪兽的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比起依赖有失败风险的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}命运之弦的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.41,0:09:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用剪刀臂和天堂之弦这2只
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明应该能攻过去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.12,0:10:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失误了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《明明忠告过你要冷静思考的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.88,0:10:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这也是我诱导的结果吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管怎样 已经…》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.59,0:10:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 机关傀儡 天堂之弦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.02,0:10:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.24,0:10:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤这只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将机关傀儡 梦魇\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.93,0:10:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）将怪兽超量解放
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤出来的梦魇{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.37,0:10:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会变成2个超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.04,0:10:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把等级8的剪刀臂和
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.83,0:10:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2只梦魇进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.33,0:10:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又出现了 新的 No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才是 我真正的王牌…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.74,0:10:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 No.88！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.96,0:10:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡 命运狮子！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力3200…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正是王者的风范…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动命运狮子的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.86,0:11:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当这家伙 把超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.38,0:11:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部失去的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.83,0:11:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就会在这场决斗中获胜。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次 把1个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.34,0:11:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是把超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要用完就能赢吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.47,0:11:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.75,0:11:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会这样！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.19,0:11:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）这就是 无敌的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.21,0:11:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}命运之狮的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.01,0:11:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}命运之狮的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.05,0:11:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材还剩1个。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.74,0:11:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下个回合 命运之狮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.44,0:11:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用掉最后一个超量素材的瞬间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙 你就输了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.18,0:12:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会吧 鲨鱼居然要输了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.66,0:12:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭鲨鱼场上的里侧守备怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.73,0:12:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是打不倒 No.的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.65,0:12:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 命运之狮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.50,0:12:11.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本不需要亲自战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种局面下已经…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我会输给{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.99,0:12:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在大会上给我设下陷阱连妹妹都伤害了的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.90,0:12:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我连一击都还没还回去难道就要这样输掉吗》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.01,0:12:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）放弃还太早了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.18,0:12:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.35,0:12:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还有获胜的路可走。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.38,0:12:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不一样，能够冷静地思考问题呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆！为什么对凌牙？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.47,0:12:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是不想让我赢吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无所谓啊，不赢也行。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.89,0:12:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说过了吧，你只要完成你的职责就好。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.45,0:12:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到目前为止做得很出色。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.15,0:12:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很好地逼紧了凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:13:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）接下来你好好休息就行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.85,0:13:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的出场已经结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆，你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Ｖ也好{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也好{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也好都不是你复仇的工具！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.23,0:13:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵……来吧凌牙找到答案了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.22,0:13:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}认输也可以哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.99,0:13:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样就没法向我们复仇了哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:22.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会复仇的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论用什么手段！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.67,0:13:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不错嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.75,0:13:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟你很聊得来。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.03,0:13:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是我看中的最强刺客。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.28,0:13:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.24,0:13:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不会为了那种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这、这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.94,0:13:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 No.卡哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.67,0:13:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼·德雷克在呼唤你。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.45,0:13:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）把它唤回来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.61,0:13:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你应该做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.53,0:13:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.36,0:13:54.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对已经…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.79,0:14:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在呼唤你哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:03.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼·德雷克
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.73,0:14:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在呼唤你。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.90,0:14:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要…》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和鲨鱼·德雷克合力打倒{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.36,0:14:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.27,0:14:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼唤吧，凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.98,0:14:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要获胜的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.05,0:14:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就只能唤回鲨鱼·德雷克{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与 No.们合为一体。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.42,0:14:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接受 No.吧，凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.50,0:14:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的话，一切都能实现。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.54,0:14:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行！住手，鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.87,0:14:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我所期望的一切…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.47,0:14:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.25,0:14:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒特隆…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.11,0:14:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完成复仇。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.86,0:14:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一切都能实现。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.79,0:15:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手～！鲨鱼，不行啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.99,0:15:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我从那一天起……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从妹妹被伤害的那天起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.83,0:15:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我的一切都献给了复仇。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.07,0:15:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要能实现它{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.72,0:15:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪怕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.04,0:15:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被恶魔夺走这副身躯{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也无所谓！》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.45,0:15:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼，不行！别去那边！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.84,0:15:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不能输！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.19,0:15:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要一直赢下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.87,0:15:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为此需要的力量……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.69,0:15:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.36,0:15:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反转召唤！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将自己场上的里侧守备怪兽\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反转召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.33,0:15:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把深渊清扫者变成攻击表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.64,0:15:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.02,0:15:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动深渊清扫者的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.42,0:15:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这张卡解放破坏永续魔法 异次元海沟！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.56,0:15:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这一瞬间 这张卡的效果也消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.80,0:16:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 鲨鱼龙回到场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.48,0:16:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.24,0:16:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来是为了这个才把深海清道夫盖放到场上……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.77,0:16:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.91,0:16:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他果然还是 没能完全斩断
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.85,0:16:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对 No.卡的诱惑吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.98,0:16:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算鲨鱼龙回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力也不过 ２８００。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.93,0:16:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打不倒３２００的命运狮子！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我获得新力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从现在开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.45,0:16:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.49,0:16:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了完成复仇我会接受一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.87,0:16:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！ 鲨鱼龙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.37,0:16:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接受我的愿望 进化吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.34,0:16:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进化……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说……！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.95,0:16:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将海咬龙 鲨鱼龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.93,0:17:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！CNo.32！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海咬龙 鲨鱼龙·恶噬！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼龙变成了 CNo.！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.39,0:17:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.14,0:17:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会拥有召唤 CNo.的力量！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.60,0:17:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮，凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.81,0:17:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做得很好。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.95,0:17:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！为什么……为什么那家伙会！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海咬龙 鲨鱼龙·恶噬的怪兽效果 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.72,0:17:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}取除1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.22,0:17:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冠有「鲨鱼」之名的怪兽除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.58,0:18:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除外的是 空气鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.32,0:18:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 将其攻击力1900{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.70,0:18:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从命运狮子那里夺走！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.33,0:18:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海咬龙 鲨鱼龙·恶噬！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.12,0:18:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击命运之狮！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.11,0:18:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深渊混沌噬！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.20,0:19:01.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼…赢了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.39,0:19:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮，凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.84,0:19:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.98,0:19:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，你也是我的同伴了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.30,0:19:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对！我是为了打倒你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.45,0:19:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才得到了新的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.51,0:19:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟我决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乐趣还是留到以后吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毕竟进入决赛的最后一个人还没定呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.91,0:19:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.13,0:19:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}急性子可不行哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.21,0:19:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的 一飞冲天
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.01,0:19:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能管用到什么程度，就让我看看吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.78,0:19:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.39,0:19:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.71,0:19:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至今为止的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.57,0:19:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少开玩笑了！事到如今还说什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.21,0:19:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没办法阻止托隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.60,0:19:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以那时候也是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.36,0:20:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我按照托隆的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.50,0:20:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你妹妹决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.96,0:20:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还用了被交给我的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.19,0:20:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((什么！？))
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.17,0:20:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我本来没打算做到那种地步。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.04,0:20:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.96,0:20:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}：托隆……托隆！！))
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.84,0:20:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我伤害了你的妹妹。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.32,0:20:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是为了救鲨鱼的妹妹！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才陷害你并且伤害了你妹妹。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.63,0:20:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一切都是我的责任。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.69,0:20:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要恨的话就恨我……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.93,0:20:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只恨我一个人吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.01,0:20:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，我求你。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.44,0:20:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救救托隆……救救父亲。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.91,0:20:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.60,0:20:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你的话，一定能救爸爸……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.95,0:20:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.61,0:21:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有，帮我转告他。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说我们在等他。和哥哥弟弟一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.65,0:21:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直在等你回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.86,0:21:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.17,0:21:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！等等，鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.23,0:21:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他……不，不只是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.69,0:21:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也都是托隆的牺牲品！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.55,0:21:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.34,0:21:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那家伙说的是真的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.68,0:21:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就要亲手把托隆打垮。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是有人妨碍我游马 我也不会手下留情！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.25,0:21:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……靠决斗来发泄复仇和怨恨{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁都不会得到幸福的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.80,0:21:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗是……决斗是……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.93,0:21:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.56,0:21:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 你就贯彻自己所相信的道路吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.42,0:21:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要你是正确的道路就一定会打开。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.73,0:22:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 我干！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.28,0:22:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管什么路我都给你劈开！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.07,0:22:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.59,0:23:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.12,0:23:45.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.89,0:23:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.83,0:23:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.96,0:23:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.59,0:23:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.75,0:23:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.49,0:24:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.34,0:24:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.70,0:24:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.42,0:24:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.97,0:24:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害 卡出现了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.77,0:24:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.88！机关傀儡·命运·狮子！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.01,0:24:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当超量素材全部消失时
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.69,0:24:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能赢得这场决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.03,0:24:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在剩下的 短暂时间里你 要做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.55,0:24:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃～ 我说什么好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.37,0:24:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，结束。

